<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-27T19:31:41.526Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 19:31:41 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistan has kept the Zangali and Torkham Iran crossings closed, creating a backlog of 2,271 trucks, while only limited trade has resumed under partial operations. The closure has driven an unprecedented rise in LPG prices, which the Pakistani minister attributes to the border shutdown, and the government has launched an operation against illegal Afghans in Peshawar and banned gatherings in Balochistan's Pishin ahead of an intensified campaign. Pakistan accuses the Taliban of using Afghan territory to launch attacks against it, while the Taliban government has reshuffled civilian and military officials in Badakhshan. The conflict recorded 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/qatar-urges-iran-to-show-goodwill-by-ending-threats-to-the-region-and-reopening-the-strait&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9OeTc1VE5lcEx0QzNhVlh6TnBVZUhfdi1MR0xZQnJOLWo2U3dHb09ucVhPNXctSTFXNTF6R3EwZEJXSl96SF9zS2FPUWFwcHpHeFVMaGtUckZiaGIydHc1SFMwT3U1R1h5WnMtY2RGUkdtYm1jV2VUMWFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE92Rzd3d043bS1sVVFnYUZFRnZiZG45YUV0ZE9GcFo3Y2h1dFg2bjM4SEpvdGUxQmRYOUdINWRoTnQxemFFS3Flcg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE12MVB0RV9NY0RzbW4wTVBDd2xoRGNENmk3a1I2M0NDX1ZNX3BadUhhOFlLckdFNk95RjJ6ZEZKeldiQ0lMRUxjdg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1DaFg2M0tJdTVMMm9CRkZBX3BBWlBveFFCMkg1LTBhT2czZ3pzOHAwQjhEN3FtcEVEeW9jTmF2Uy0zMU5MeUhjNw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/a